This product builds on ideas and logic from the following projects:
  - "quant-trading" by je-suis-tm (https://github.com/je-suis-tm/quant-trading),
    Apache License 2.0. The MACD trend filter is the origin of the trend score.
  - "TradingAgents" by TauricResearch (https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents),
    Apache License 2.0. The agent roles, rating scale and settled-decision memory.
  - "trading-terminal" by Superior-Trade (https://github.com/Superior-Trade/trading-terminal),
    Apache License 2.0. The deterministic guard on model output and decision logging.
No source code from these projects is included. See docs/research-notes.md.

Market data is downloaded at run time from third-party datasets and is not distributed
with this repository:
  - github.com/Johnbrick123/sp500-data
  - github.com/finom/static-klines (Binance klines)
  - github.com/axb0306/cme-futures-ohlc
